ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator using Gemini Models
Project Documentation
1. Introduction
ComicCraft is an AI-powered comic story creation application designed to transform a simple user idea into a structured and editable comic. The system uses Gemini models to assist with story generation, character development, scene creation, dialogue, narration, and panel descriptions.
The application aims to make comic creation accessible to users who may not have professional writing, illustration, or comic-design skills.
________________________________________
2. Abstract
Comic creation traditionally requires multiple skills such as creative writing, character development, dialogue writing, scene planning, illustration, and page layout. This can make the process difficult and time-consuming, particularly for beginners.
ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator using Gemini Models addresses this challenge by providing an AI-assisted platform for generating comic content from natural-language prompts. Users can enter a simple story idea, select a genre and tone, and allow the system to generate a structured story containing characters, scenes, panels, dialogue, and narration.
The generated content can be reviewed and modified through an interactive comic editor. The system is designed around a structured representation of the comic so that individual characters, scenes, and panels can be edited or regenerated without recreating the entire project.
The project demonstrates the practical application of generative AI in creative content production while keeping the user involved in the creative process.
________________________________________
3. Problem Statement
Creating a complete comic manually requires considerable time and multiple creative skills.
Users typically need to:
•	Develop a story.
•	Create characters.
•	Plan scenes.
•	Write dialogue.
•	Design panels.
•	Create artwork.
•	Arrange pages.
•	Edit and publish the final comic.
Beginners may find these tasks difficult to coordinate.
Therefore, there is a need for an intelligent system that can assist users throughout the comic-creation process while allowing them to maintain control over the generated content.
