7. Functional Requirements
7.1 User Management
The system should allow users to:
•	Register.
•	Log in.
•	Log out.
•	Manage their profile.
•	Access their own projects.
7.2 Comic Project Management
Users should be able to:
•	Create projects.
•	Rename projects.
•	Open projects.
•	Save projects.
•	Delete projects.
•	Continue previously created comics.
7.3 Story Generation
Users provide:
•	Story idea
•	Genre
•	Tone
•	Length
•	Optional character information
Gemini generates a structured story.
7.4 Character Generation
The system generates:
•	Name
•	Age
•	Role
•	Personality
•	Appearance
•	Background
•	Relationships
7.5 Scene and Panel Generation
The system converts the story into scenes and panels.
Each panel may contain:
•	Visual description
•	Characters
•	Actions
•	Dialogue
•	Narration
•	Sound effects
•	Visual-generation prompt
7.6 Comic Editing
Users can:
•	Edit story content.
•	Modify characters.
•	Change dialogue.
•	Add or delete panels.
•	Reorder panels.
•	Regenerate selected content.
•	Replace artwork.
7.7 Export
Users can preview and export completed comics in supported formats.
