8. Non-Functional Requirements
Performance
The application should provide responsive interaction and handle AI generation delays gracefully.
Usability
The interface should be simple enough for users without technical or comic-design experience.
Reliability
The system should preserve user work even if AI or network requests fail.
Security
•	API credentials must remain server-side.
•	User data must be protected.
•	Project access must be restricted to authorized users.
Scalability
The architecture should allow additional users, AI capabilities, genres, and comic styles to be added later.
Maintainability
Frontend, backend, AI services, and database components should remain modular.
