Handles creation, storage, modification, and deletion of comic projects.
Module 3 – AI Story Generator
Uses Gemini to transform user ideas into structured stories.
Module 4 – Character Generator
Creates and maintains character profiles.
Module 5 – Scene Generator
Divides the story into logical scenes.
Module 6 – Panel Generator
Converts scenes into comic panels.
Module 7 – Dialogue Generator
