27. Conclusion
ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator using Gemini Models demonstrates how generative AI can assist in the creative process of comic production. The system combines AI story generation, character development, scene planning, panel generation, dialogue creation, visual generation, and interactive editing into one workflow.
The project's central concept is:
From a simple idea to an editable comic.
By using a structured representation of stories and panels, ComicCraft allows AI-generated content to be modified rather than treated as a final, fixed output. This makes the platform suitable as a practical academic project while also providing a foundation for future extensions such as interactive comics, animation, multilingual generation, and collaborative creation.

